#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:7
msgid "Surrogate modeling"
msgstr "サロゲートモデリング"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:9
msgid ""
"`TrainingSet` builds training data from an Archive or Population, and "
"`Surrogate` predicts objective values from that data. `SurrogateManager` "
"coordinates when fitting and prediction occur, while "
"`AcquisitionFunction` converts predictions into scores for candidate "
"selection. `AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher` switches the "
"`SurrogateManager` or `OptimizationStrategy` according to prediction-"
"accuracy evaluations."
msgstr "`TrainingSet`はアーカイブまたは個体群から学習データを作り、`Surrogate`はそのデータから目的値を予測します。`SurrogateManager`はフィットと予測のタイミングを調整し、`AcquisitionFunction`は予測を候補選択用のスコアに変換します。`AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher`は、予測精度の評価に応じて`SurrogateManager`または`OptimizationStrategy`を切り替えます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:17
msgid "Surrogate"
msgstr "{fa}`brain;sd-mr-1` サロゲート"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:20
msgid "Fits a model from training data and returns predictions for candidates."
msgstr "学習データからモデルをフィットし、候補の予測を返します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:23
msgid "SurrogateManager"
msgstr "{fa}`sitemap;sd-mr-1` サロゲートマネージャー"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:26
msgid "Coordinates model fitting and batch prediction."
msgstr "モデルのフィットとバッチ予測を調整します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:29
msgid "TrainingSet"
msgstr "{fa}`database;sd-mr-1` 学習データ集合"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:32
msgid "Builds training inputs and labels from an Archive or Population."
msgstr "ArchiveまたはPopulationから学習用の入力とラベルを構築します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:35
msgid "AcquisitionFunction"
msgstr "{fa}`calculator;sd-mr-1` 獲得関数"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:38
msgid "Converts predictions into scalar scores for candidate selection."
msgstr "予測結果を候補選択用のスカラー値に変換します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:41
msgid "AccuracyBasedSurrogateSwitcher"
msgstr "{fa}`toggle-on;sd-mr-1` 精度ベースのサロゲート切り替え"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling.md:44
msgid ""
"Evaluates Surrogate accuracy and switches the configuration used during a"
" run."
msgstr "サロゲートの精度を評価し、実行中に使う構成を切り替えます。"
